BAD EXPORT

  × The (..) syntax is for exposing variants of a custom type. It cannot be used
  │ with a type alias like `name` though.
   ╭─[Main.nash:1:1]
 1 │ name = other
   · ────
 2 │ other = name
   ╰────
  help: Remove the (..) and you should be fine!
